  QUICK REFERENCE CHEAT SHEET
================================================================

  Lifecycle:
  ----------
  docker pull <image>          Download image from registry
  docker run <image>           Create and start a container
  docker start <container>     Start a stopped container
  docker stop <container>      Gracefully stop a container
  docker kill <container>      Force stop a container
  docker rm <container>        Delete a container
  docker rmi <image>           Delete an image

  Info & Monitoring:
  ------------------
  docker ps -a                 List all containers
  docker images                List all images
  docker logs <container>      View container logs
  docker inspect <container>   Full container details (JSON)
  docker stats                 Live resource usage

  Build & Share:
  --------------
  docker build -t name:tag .   Build image from Dockerfile
  docker push name:tag         Push image to registry
  docker pull name:tag         Pull image from registry
  docker tag src:tag dest:tag  Tag an image with new name

